 * Minimal semantic-version helpers used across the scanner: normalizing the
 * version strings found in lockfiles and OSV `introduced`/`fixed` events, and
 * deciding whether a locked version falls inside an OSV affected range.
 *
 * Deliberately dependency-free: a full semver library would be a runtime
